# AURA 2.0

AURA 2.0 is a full-stack AI personal assistant platform for chat, data analysis, image generation, video concepting, offline support, and location-aware workflows. This starter repo sets up a modern backend and frontend with AI provider integrations, a clean architecture, and a developer-friendly local setup.

## What this project includes

- AI chat assistant with OpenAI-compatible integration
- Data analysis and insight endpoints
- Image generation prompt workflow
- Video concept generation workflow
- Frontend dashboard for interacting with the assistant
- Modular backend service layer and routes
- Documentation and architecture guidance

